303
00:24:15,670 --> 00:24:19,011
[SPEAKER_02]: It's a much stronger visual that helps define the space.

304
00:24:19,491 --> 00:24:23,972
[SPEAKER_02]: And I think they are a lot more effective than just a regular shower.

305
00:24:24,052 --> 00:24:35,374
[SPEAKER_02]: But I was kind of wondering if those are something that we're going to use and adopt, where and in what circumstances do you feel they would be best used?

306
