816
01:17:28,402 --> 01:17:48,867
[SPEAKER_12]: So I feel like we could kind of take the best of each, but we wanna make sure that someone who's kind of new to the streets could maybe follow the breadcrumbs without having to get out their phone and look at Google and every block and try and figure out which way they're gonna go, because that's very slow and intimidating.

817
01:17:49,547 --> 01:17:51,908
