01:18:13,953 --> 01:18:15,675
[SPEAKER_11]: So it's definitely going to be easier from a

824
01:18:17,304 --> 01:18:31,158
[SPEAKER_11]: from a layman's side to just have options and then discuss among options rather than trying to navigate the ashtos and naktos of the world.

825
01:18:36,872 --> 01:18:46,477
[SPEAKER_14]: Um, so we should move on to, um, Winthrop street is the most pressing thing on the list.

